# Unwrapping AI — Zero to Transformer

**A visual, hands-on learning journey from machine learning fundamentals to Transformers.**

**Creator:** Nitin K. Sethi

## About This Project

Zero to Transformer is a practical learning series designed to explain the concepts behind machine learning and deep learning through simple explanations, Python implementations, experiments, and visualizations.

The objective is to understand not only how to write the code, but also **why each technique works, when to use it, and how it contributes to building intelligent systems.**

We will progress through 12 learning milestones, from fundamental data concepts to Transformer architectures, using Google Colab and Python.

